ces-panel","content":"Variable"},"622":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-151","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"Purpose"},"623":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-152","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"`LAB_WORKSPACE_HOST`"},"624":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-153","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"Hostname/IP the browser uses to reach Coder/Kasm (e.g. node IP)"},"625":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-154","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"`CODER_PORT` / `KASM_PORT`"},"626":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-155","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"NodePorts (default `32080` / `32081`)"},"627":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-156","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"`NEXT_PUBLIC_CODER_URL` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_KASM_URL`"},"628":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-157","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"Optional full URL overrides for iframe `src`"},"629":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-158","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"**CLI equivalents:**"},"630":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-159","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"The dashboard utility `scripts/utilities/dev-workspaces.sh` wraps the same logic for the UI. RBAC in `k8s/dev/dashboard/rbac.yaml` grants the dashboard ServiceAccount Helm lifecycle in `coder` and `kasm` namespaces only."},"631":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-160","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"**Safety:** Toggling workspaces does not touch `ai-inference` Jobs. Still run `stop-dev` / `stop` before node reboot."},"632":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-161","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#dashboard-workspaces-panel","content":"See `dashboard/AGENTS.md` and `dashboard/Dockerfile` for stack details."},"633":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-162","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"All components declare requests + limits (see group\\_vars and values)."},"634":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-163","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"Inference unchanged: Jobs, OnFailure + backoff 1, Mode A vLLM util ≤ 0.82 (Mode B exclusive 0.85 / Mode C SGLang 0.95), NCCL highspeed only in relevant workloads, no Always."},"635":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-164","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"Dev tools are intentionally lighter and restart-tolerant."},"636":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-165","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"`manage.sh` new paths have preflight cluster checks; heavy prompts untouched."},"637":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-166","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"After changes always validate: `bazelisk test //...`"},"638":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-167","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"Before reboot: `./scripts/manage.sh stop-dev ; ./scripts/manage.sh stop`"},"639":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-168","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#updating--versions","content":"Pin via group\\_vars. Re-run the dev playbook to upgrade."},"640":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-169","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#updating--versions","content":"For custom UI changes: edit the Next.js app under `dashboard/`, rebuild the image, and roll the deployment."},"641":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-170","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#troubleshooting","content":"Coder workspaces stuck \"connecting\": ensure CODER\\_ACCESS\\_URL points to reachable (NodePort or DNS)."},"642":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-171","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#troubleshooting","content":"Metrics empty: check GPU Operator installed + DCGM; `kubectl get pods -n gpu-operator`."},"643":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-172","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#troubleshooting","content":"Port conflict: override nodeports in values or inventory."},"644":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-173","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcon