type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c","content":"K3s/Flannel stay on the LAN. Mode B and Mode C Jobs use `hostNetwork: true` and `hostIPC: true`. Realistic ring bus is \\~12–24 GB/s allgather. Optional GB10 UMA livelock fallback (not default): `NCCL_NET_GDR_LEVEL=0`. Mode C also sets NCCL buffer cuts (`NCCL_BUFFSIZE=1MiB`) so pinned host RAM does not eat the head."},"1196":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-39","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Node"},"1197":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-40","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Job"},"1198":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-41","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Checkpoint"},"1199":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-42","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Aliases"},"1200":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-43","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"spark0"},"1201":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-44","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litel